# Data model reference

## Core tables (minimum fields)
- **DesignConcept**: DesignId bigint PK; IdeaRef varchar unique; ProductTypeId;
  CollectionName; SeasonId; DesignHeadEmployeeId; Priority; ConceptNote;
  CurrentStage; Status; CreatedBy; CreatedAtUtc; RowVersion.
- **DesignComponent**: DesignComponentId; DesignId FK; ComponentTypeId;
  Specification; Sequence; Active.
- **DesignImage**: ImageId; DesignId; DesignComponentId nullable; StorageKey;
  FileName; ContentType; FileSize; IsPrimary; UploadedBy; UploadedAtUtc.
- **DesignProcess**: DesignProcessId; DesignId; ProcessId; Sequence; Status;
  PlannedStart; PlannedEnd; ActualStart; ActualEnd.
- **DesignSubProcess**: DesignSubProcessId; DesignProcessId; SubProcessId;
  Sequence; Status; DependencyId nullable.
- **WorkflowPattern**: WorkflowPatternId; Name; ProductTypeId nullable;
  VersionNo; Active; EffectiveFrom/To.
- **WorkflowPatternTask**: PatternTaskId; WorkflowPatternId; ProcessId;
  SubProcessId; DefaultRoleId; ExpectedMinutes; DayOffset; Priority; Sequence;
  DependencySequence.
- **DesignTask**: TaskId; DesignId; ProcessId; SubProcessId;
  AssignedEmployeeId; AssignedRoleId; Status; Priority; ExpectedMinutes;
  PlannedStart; DueAt; StartedAt; CompletedAt; OutputRemark; RowVersion.
- **TaskTimeEvent**: EventId; TaskId; EmployeeId; EventType; HoldReasonId
  nullable; Remark; EventTimeUtc; CreatedBy; SourceDeviceId/IP optional.
- **TaskHoldReason**: HoldReasonId; Code; Name; ExcludeFromActiveTime;
  DelayOwnerCategory; Active.
- **DesignCorrection**: CorrectionId; DesignId; TaskId; CorrectionType;
  ResponsibleEmployeeId; RaisedBy; RootCause; ExtraMinutes; ExtraCost;
  RatingImpact; Status; timestamps.
- **DesignApproval**: ApprovalId; DesignId; TaskId nullable; ApprovalLevelId;
  ApproverEmployeeId; Decision; Remark; DecisionAtUtc.
- **EmployeeKpiDefinition**: KpiDefinitionId; RoleId; MetricCode;
  WeightPercent; Target; Effective dates.
- **EmployeeKpiScore**: KpiScoreId; EmployeeId; PeriodYear; PeriodMonth;
  MetricCode; Score; WeightedScore; CalculatedAtUtc; CalculationVersion.
- **AuditLog**: AuditId; EntityType; EntityId; Action; BeforeJson; AfterJson;
  UserId; AtUtc; CorrelationId.

## Recommended indexes
- `UX_DesignConcept_IdeaRef` (unique)
- `IX_DesignTask_AssignedEmployee_Status_DueAt`
- `IX_DesignTask_DesignId_Process_SubProcess`
- `IX_TaskTimeEvent_TaskId_EventTimeUtc`, `IX_TaskTimeEvent_EmployeeId_EventTimeUtc`
- `IX_DesignCorrection_ResponsibleEmployee_Status`
- `IX_DesignApproval_DesignId_Level_Decision`
- `IX_EmployeeKpiScore_Employee_Period`
- Archive/partition strategy for `AuditLog` at high volume

## Status values
| Entity | Statuses |
|---|---|
| Design | DRAFT, ACTIVE, ON_HOLD, APPROVAL_PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED, PRODUCTION_RELEASED, LIVE, CLOSED |
| Task | PENDING, ASSIGNED, RUNNING, ON_HOLD, CHECKING, CORRECTION_REQUIRED, COMPLETED, CANCELLED |
| Correction | OPEN, ASSIGNED, IN_PROGRESS, CHECKING, DONE, REJECTED |
| Approval | PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED, CORRECTION_REQUIRED, SKIPPED |
| Time Event | START, HOLD, RESUME, END, OFFICE_CLOSE, ADMIN_ADJUSTMENT |

## Transaction/concurrency rules
| Scenario | Required behavior |
|---|---|
| Create design + auto tasks | Single transaction; roll back design if task generation fails |
| Start task | Atomic check: no other RUNNING task for employee, then insert START + update task |
| Hold/resume/end | Validate current state via RowVersion or equivalent optimistic concurrency |
| Reassignment | Never overwrite history; store reassignment event/audit, update current assignee |
| Approval | Prevent duplicate active approval at same level unless configured |
| Correction close | May unlock/advance dependent task only in the same transaction |
| Production release | Validate final approval + mandatory costing/files before marking released |
